post_title:
This semester, 5 students 👨🏻‍🔧🧑🏼‍🌾👨🏼‍🏭👷🏼‍♂️👩🏼‍⚕️ from 4 departments 📈🔭⚒️🧱 each completed their masters on a portion of a comprehensive waste management strategy for the biggest tourist 🏝️destination in Malawi 🇲🇼 and how they are finished 🥳! 

All of their work will be published on our website shortly: https://lnkd.in/g_bjzANM 

@Josch Stricker: Waste Logistics and Transport Modelling. 
@Elena Abgottspon: Economic Feasibility of Waste Collection. 
@Raphael Meier: Waste Separation and Valorisation Pathways. 
@Philippe Colbach: Glass Crusher Construction and Waste Valorization Evaluation. 
Mosè Peduzzi : Development of a Low-Cost Incinerator.
